Know the Early Signs of AC Trouble
Most air conditioning systems give warning signs before they completely stop working. Recognizing these symptoms early can save both time and money.
Common signs include:
    • Warm air blowing from vents
    • Weak or uneven airflow
    • Strange noises during operation
    • Water leaking around the indoor unit
    • Unpleasant odors
    • Frequent system cycling
    • Higher monthly energy bills
    • Rooms cooling unevenly
Ignoring these issues may allow minor problems to become costly repairs.
